WEBVTT

00:00:29.313 --> 00:00:32.159
It's true. For how much, do you think?

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:34.100
What would you guess?

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.805
Five hundred dollars?

00:00:35.805 --> 00:00:39.140
It's not the Ritz-Carlton. It's a jail!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.164
Eighty-two dollars a night.

00:00:41.164 --> 00:00:43.536
Eighty-two dollars a night.

00:00:43.536 --> 00:00:45.736
If you go to an amusement park

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:48.428
and don't want to stand in the long lines

00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:49.884
for the popular rides,

00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:52.771
there is now a solution.

00:00:52.771 --> 00:00:57.035
In many theme parks, you can pay extra

00:00:57.035 --> 00:00:58.649
to jump to the head of the line.

00:00:58.649 --> 00:01:03.164
They call them Fast Track or VIP tickets.